<title>UK: TABLE-3i yr net asset value rises 14.1 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-3i yr net asset value rises 14.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to end-March 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Net asset value/shr    486		 vs 426</p>
<p> Earnings per share     15.5		vs 11.9</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 9.2		 vs 8.1</p>
<p> Final dividend	   5.7		 vs n/a</p>
<p> Amount invested	  742.3	     vs 613.0</p>
<p> Tax			  4.2		 vs 20.3</p>
<p> Revenue pretax profit  105.6	     vs 88.9</p>
<p> Capital return	   320.8	     vs 457.9</p>
<p> Revenue return	   62.9		vs 94.7</p>
<p> Total return	     520.8	     vs 415.5</p>
<p> Total return/shr (p)   70.4		vs 88.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the British venture capital company is 3I Group Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
